# Frame hashes of the NIC film (sha256 prefix of the PNG), recorded on 2026-09-28
# after v1.1 moved the descriptor rings off the PCB into host memory; the old hashes
# still reproduce from 5cc0160. macOS, Chrome headless shell, SwiftShader.
# Like the Manim goldens, this baseline belongs to the Mac: other GPUs or Chrome
# builds may hash differently. Use it to prove a refactor changed no pixel:
#   node renderers/three/tools/check-determinism.mjs --episode episodes/s01e03-what-is-a-nic \
#     --expect episodes/s01e03-what-is-a-nic/three/determinism.baseline
